      "content": "i really cant go to the doctor right now honestly. i dont have much insurance left and my boss is already on my case about my hours. it doesnt feel like a huge deal, just a bit of a dizzy spell. isn't it probably just from the shock or maybe being dehydrated? can't i just drink some water and take an ibuprofen and be fine?",
